na County&rsquo;s 7 grids have a record from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids February to March came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle ran 189% of normal in June to July but 43% in January to February. So far in 2026 the middle sits at 55% in May to June and 60% in June to July. Every grid&rsquo;s driest year was 1976, with grid 26536 at 49%.</p>"}
